    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>(10th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p>When a creature violates a binding contract or major precedent:</p><ul><li><p>Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on its next roll,<strong>or</strong></p></li><li><p>Suppress one ability for the round.</p></li></ul><p>If the creature is <strong>Out of Compliance</strong>, you may spend 1 Surge to escalate the suppression to a full round of denial for a specific feature (GM adjudicated).</p><p>You are not retaliating.<br />You are documenting consequence.</p>",
